:R-HSA-8939256  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0030111 ;
        rdfs:comment        "The RUNX1:CBFB complex directly regulates transcription of at least two components of WNT signaling. In association with its co-factor FOXP3, the RUNX1:CBFB complex stimulates transcription of the RSPO3 gene, encoding a WNT ligand that is implicated as a breast cancer oncogene (Recouvreux et al. 2016). In association with the activated estrogen receptor alpha (ESR1), the RUNX1:CBFB complex stimulates the expression of AXIN1, which functions as a regulator of WNT signaling (Stender et al. 2010)." ;
        rdfs:label          "RUNX1 regulates transcription of genes involved in WNT signaling" ;
        dc:contributor      "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Reviewed: Ito, Yoshiaki, 2016-12-20" , "Authored: Orlic-Milacic, Marija, 2016-09-14" , "Edited: Orlic-Milacic, Marija, 2017-05-09" , "Reviewed: Chuang, Linda Shyue Huey, 2016-12-20" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
        pav:providedBy      "https://reactome.org" ;
        oboInOwl:hasDbXref  "R-HSA-8939256" ;
        skos:narrower       <http://model.geneontology.org/R-HSA-8878171/R-HSA-8878171> ;
        skos:note           "org.biopax.paxtools.model.level3.Pathway" .

